{"seq":2,"slug":"randomness","title":"随机性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/practice/randomness","wordCount":2100,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"随机性\">随机性</h1><p>抛一枚公平硬币 20 次，你更可能相信哪个结果是「真随机」得到的：01010101010101010101，还是 00101110100110100101？直觉说后者。但按概率论，两个具体序列的出现概率<strong>完全相等</strong>，都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。概率论无法解释为什么第一个看起来「有规律、不随机」而第二个「杂乱、随机」——因为概率是关于事件类的，而「这个具体序列随机吗」问的是单个对象的性质。要回答它，得离开概率论，走进计算理论。柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度与算法随机性，正是为单个序列的随机性提供严格定义的理论，也为整个概率大厦补上了它自己回答不了的一块基石。本篇是全 hub 讨论算法随机性的主场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度\">核心概念：柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度</h2><p>洞见来自一个朴素想法：随机的序列<strong>无法被压缩</strong>。01010101… 有规律，可以用一句短程序「重复 01 十次」生成；杂乱的序列没有规律，要生成它，程序几乎只能把整个序列照抄一遍。于是「随机」被重新定义为「不可压缩」。</p>\n<p>柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 定义为：在一台通用图灵机上，能输出字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>最短程序的长度</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)=\\min\\{\\,|p| : U(p)=x\\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是通用图灵机，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|p|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是程序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的比特长度。有规律的串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>（可压缩）；随机的串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)\\approx |x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>（几乎不可压缩，最短程序就是「打印这串」本身）。一个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的串称为 <strong>柯尔莫哥洛夫随机</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)\\ge n-c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为小常数）。这把「随机」从关于序列的模糊直觉，变成了关于序列的精确计算性质——彻底不依赖概率分布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SEQ[单个序列 x] --&gt; Q{它随机吗?}&#10;  Q --&gt; PROB[概率论:两序列同概率 2^-n&lt;br/&gt;答不了单序列问题]&#10;  Q --&gt; KC[柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度 K x]&#10;  KC --&gt; DEF[K x 等于 输出 x 的最短程序长度]&#10;  DEF --&gt; LOW[有规律串:K x 远小于 n 可压缩]&#10;  DEF --&gt; HIGH[杂乱串:K x 约等于 n 不可压缩]&#10;  HIGH --&gt; RAND[K x 大于等于 n 减 c 到 柯氏随机]&#10;  KC --&gt; NC[代价:K x 不可计算&lt;br/&gt;见下]\">flowchart TD\n  SEQ[单个序列 x] --&gt; Q{它随机吗?}\n  Q --&gt; PROB[概率论:两序列同概率 2^-n&lt;br/&gt;答不了单序列问题]\n  Q --&gt; KC[柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度 K x]\n  KC --&gt; DEF[K x 等于 输出 x 的最短程序长度]\n  DEF --&gt; LOW[有规律串:K x 远小于 n 可压缩]\n  DEF --&gt; HIGH[杂乱串:K x 约等于 n 不可压缩]\n  HIGH --&gt; RAND[K x 大于等于 n 减 c 到 柯氏随机]\n  KC --&gt; NC[代价:K x 不可计算&lt;br/&gt;见下]</pre><p>值得强调的核心事实：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>不可计算的</strong>——不存在算法对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（否则可导出停机问题的解，与哥德尔-图灵的不可判定性同源，见 <a href=\"../../formal-logic/first-order-logic/godel-incompleteness\">形式逻辑 · 哥德尔不完备</a>）。随机性因此有一层深刻的反讽：我们能精确定义它，却无法机械地验证任一具体序列是否随机。绝大多数序列是随机的（不可压缩的串占绝大多数），但对任何给定的串，我们通常无法证明它随机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条道路殊途同归\">三条道路殊途同归</h2><p>柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度不是刻画随机性的唯一路径。20 世纪有三条独立发展的进路，最终被证明（对无穷序列）等价，这种「多路殊途同归」本身强烈暗示我们抓住了「随机」的真正本质。</p>\n<p>第一条是<strong>不可压缩性</strong>（柯尔莫哥洛夫、莱文）：随机即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度高，如上。第二条是<strong>不可预测性</strong>（冯·米塞斯的集合体 + 丘奇的可计算选择函数，后由维勒-马丁-洛夫精化）：随机序列上，任何可计算的下注策略都无法获得无界收益——你赌不赢它。这直接呼应了 <a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a> 里冯·米塞斯的集合体条件（子序列频次不变），只是把「可容许的选择规则」精确化为「可计算的策略」。第三条是<strong>不可被测度论意义的稀有事件命中</strong>（马丁-洛夫 1966）：随机序列不落在任何「可有效构造的零测集」里——它通过一切可计算的统计检验。</p>\n<p>马丁-洛夫随机成为标准定义，因为它最贴合概率直觉：一个序列随机，当且仅当它不表现出任何「概率为零」的可检测规律。三条道路的汇合，是可计算性理论最优美的结果之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>进路</th>\n<th>随机的含义</th>\n<th>主要人物</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不可压缩性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 接近序列长度</td>\n<td>柯尔莫哥洛夫、莱文</td>\n<td>没有更短的描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可预测性</td>\n<td>可计算赌策不能赢</td>\n<td>冯·米塞斯、丘奇、维勒</td>\n<td>赌不赢它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测度论稀有性</td>\n<td>通过一切有效统计检验</td>\n<td>马丁-洛夫</td>\n<td>不落入可构造零测集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"过程随机与产物随机\">过程随机与产物随机</h2><p>随机性哲学里有一个易被混淆、却极重要的区分：随机是指<strong>产生过程</strong>还是<strong>产物本身</strong>？这个区分直接连回概率解释之争。</p>\n<p><strong>过程随机</strong>（process randomness）指生成机制是随机的——一枚公平硬币的抛掷过程是随机的，无论它这次碰巧产出什么。这与倾向解释（见 <a href=\"../objective/propensity\">倾向解释</a>）和客观机会（见 <a href=\"../objective/best-system\">最佳系统解释</a>）挂钩：过程随机就是生成装置具有客观机会。<strong>产物随机</strong>（product randomness）指结果对象本身不可压缩——这正是柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度刻画的。</p>\n<p>二者可以分离，这是关键。一个随机过程可以偶然产出高度规律的产物：公平硬币确实可能抛出 20 个连续正面，这个产物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度极低（不是产物随机的），但生成它的过程仍是随机的。反过来，一个完全确定的过程（如圆周率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 的展开）可以产出看起来通过许多统计检验的产物——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 被猜测是「正规数」，但它由确定算法生成，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mtext> 的前 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> 位</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(\\pi \\text{ 的前 } n \\text{ 位})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的前</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，远非产物随机。「伪随机数」就活在这条缝里：过程确定（可复现），产物却能骗过弱统计检验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[随机性] --&gt; PROC[过程随机&lt;br/&gt;生成机制随机]&#10;  R --&gt; PROD[产物随机&lt;br/&gt;结果对象不可压缩]&#10;  PROC --&gt; LINK1[连 倾向/客观机会&lt;br/&gt;见 2_objective]&#10;  PROD --&gt; LINK2[连 柯氏复杂度/马丁-洛夫]&#10;  PROC --&gt; SEP1[公平硬币抛出20连正:&lt;br/&gt;过程随机 但产物不随机]&#10;  PROD --&gt; SEP2[pi 的展开:&lt;br/&gt;确定过程 但貌似通过检验]&#10;  SEP2 --&gt; PRNG[伪随机数活在这条缝里&lt;br/&gt;过程确定 产物骗过弱检验]\">flowchart TD\n  R[随机性] --&gt; PROC[过程随机&lt;br/&gt;生成机制随机]\n  R --&gt; PROD[产物随机&lt;br/&gt;结果对象不可压缩]\n  PROC --&gt; LINK1[连 倾向/客观机会&lt;br/&gt;见 2_objective]\n  PROD --&gt; LINK2[连 柯氏复杂度/马丁-洛夫]\n  PROC --&gt; SEP1[公平硬币抛出20连正:&lt;br/&gt;过程随机 但产物不随机]\n  PROD --&gt; SEP2[pi 的展开:&lt;br/&gt;确定过程 但貌似通过检验]\n  SEP2 --&gt; PRNG[伪随机数活在这条缝里&lt;br/&gt;过程确定 产物骗过弱检验]</pre><h2 id=\"随机性给概率哲学补的基石\">随机性给概率哲学补的基石</h2><p>绕这么大一圈到计算理论，对概率哲学到底有什么用？三点回报值得记账。</p>\n<p>其一，它<strong>为频率解释的集合体补全了严格定义</strong>。冯·米塞斯说随机序列是「任何选择规则都不改变子序列频次」的序列，但「选择规则」若不加限制会导致矛盾（总能事后挑出全是正面的子序列）。把选择规则精确化为「可计算函数」，正是算法随机性的贡献，它让 <a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a> 的核心概念第一次站稳。</p>\n<p>其二，它<strong>为单次随机性提供了概率论给不了的意义</strong>。概率论只能说事件类的概率，说不了「这个序列随机吗」；柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度让「这个对象是随机的」成为有真值的断言，填补了概率语言的一处根本空白。</p>\n<p>其三，它<strong>连接了随机与信息、简单性</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 同时是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的信息量与描述复杂度，这把随机性、信息论、以及 <a href=\"../objective/best-system\">最佳系统解释</a> 里的「简单性」焊在一起——最佳系统追求的「简单」，本质就是低描述复杂度。索洛莫诺夫更以此为基础提出算法概率与通用归纳，试图给 <a href=\"problem-of-induction\">归纳问题</a> 一个形式化的（虽仍不可计算的）最优解。可以说，算法随机性是概率、归纳、信息、机器学习共同的地基，在 2026 年的可解释 AI 与压缩即智能（compression-as-intelligence）讨论中持续发热。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率论无法回答「这个具体序列随机吗」——两个等长序列同概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；单序列随机性需离开概率论，走进计算理论。</li>\n<li><strong>柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的最短程序长度；随机即不可压缩（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(x)\\approx|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 不可计算（同源于停机问题），故随机性可精确定义却不可机械验证。</li>\n<li>三条进路——不可压缩性、不可预测性（可计算赌策不能赢）、测度论稀有性（通过一切有效检验）——殊途同归，马丁-洛夫随机为标准定义。</li>\n<li><strong>过程随机 vs 产物随机</strong>：前者是生成机制随机（连倾向/客观机会），后者是产物不可压缩（连柯氏复杂度）；二者可分离，伪随机数活在「过程确定、产物骗过弱检验」的缝里。</li>\n<li>算法随机性给概率哲学补基石：严格化频率解释的集合体、赋予单次随机性以意义、把随机与信息/简单性/归纳焊在一起（索洛莫诺夫通用归纳）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../objective/frequentism\">频率解释</a>（集合体的严格化）、<a href=\"../objective/propensity\">倾向解释</a> 与 <a href=\"../objective/best-system\">最佳系统解释</a>（过程随机与简单性）、<a href=\"problem-of-induction\">归纳问题</a>（索洛莫诺夫通用归纳）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../formal-logic/first-order-logic/godel-incompleteness\">形式逻辑 · 哥德尔不完备</a>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 不可计算之源）、<a href=\"../../philosophy-of-mathematics/contemporary/computation-proof-ai-mathematics\">数学哲学 · 计算·证明与AI</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"随机性","id":"随机性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度","id":"核心概念-柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"三条道路殊途同归","id":"三条道路殊途同归"},{"level":2,"text":"过程随机与产物随机","id":"过程随机与产物随机"},{"level":2,"text":"随机性给概率哲学补的基石","id":"随机性给概率哲学补的基石"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"归纳问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/practice/problem-of-induction"},"next":{"title":"应用与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-probability/practice/philosophy-of-probability-in-practice"}}